<h1>The Witness — Support</h1>
<p>The Witness is built and maintained by Marion Moranetz. Email is the fastest way to get a response.</p>
<h2>Common questions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Lost data after reinstall?</strong> The Witness is local-first. Use iCloud sync (if enabled in Settings) before deleting the app to preserve data across reinstalls.</li>
<li><strong>Apple Health integration not working?</strong> Open the iOS Settings app → Health → Data Access &amp; Devices → The Witness → confirm read/write permissions are enabled for the categories the app needs.</li>
<li><strong>Bug or feature request?</strong> Email me with the iOS version, the device model, and steps to reproduce.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>The Witness does not collect or sell your data. See the <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<p class="contact"><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:marionmoranetz@gmail.com">marionmoranetz@gmail.com</a></p>
